{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217760","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217760","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621776001:1":{"text":"어라, 하룻밤밖에 안 지났는데 너희가 왜 나를 이렇게 차갑게 바라보는 걸까. 아마도...","source_cn":"亲爱的朋友们……只过了短短一个晚上，你们看我的眼神却变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A592972085E781A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621776002:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">내가 거울 분신이라는 걸 알아버려서 그렇겠지?</style>","source_cn":"<style=highlight>你们知道我是镜中人了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E5E35D8FAD3CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621776003:1":{"text":"어, 어떻게...","source_cn":"你、你怎么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197B29F2F02CAA2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621776004:1":{"text":"날 찾고 있다는 건 알고 있었어. 도서관에서 너희를 봤거든.","source_cn":"我知道你们在找我，也在图书馆里看到了你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD522914D24B683EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621776005:1":{"text":"...그날, 도서관에서 난 소리는 역시...!","source_cn":"……那天，那天那个在图书馆发出声音的，果然是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5E0493B60B1FB16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen